Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cf80708d-aa6a-366b-80ac-8e9db5fca163.xml</text>
